{"title":"Career Roadmap · Digital Fabrication Specialist","role":"Digital Fabrication Specialist","summary":"A Digital Fabrication Specialist translates computational and digital designs into physical components, prototypes, architectural elements and structures using CNC machining, laser cutting, 3D printing, robotic fabrication and other digitally controlled manufacturing technologies.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Digital Fabrication Specialist translates computational and digital designs into physical components, prototypes, architectural elements and structures using CNC machining, laser cutting, 3D printing, robotic fabrication and other digitally controlled manufacturing technologies."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Arch graduate, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architecture","Computational Design","Parametric Modeling","Fabrication","Material Systems","Robotics","Digital Manufacturing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The role connects the complete pipeline:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Design","Parametric Model","Computational Geometry","Fabrication Data","Machine / Robot","Physical Prototype","Architectural Component"]},{"type":"p","text":"The specialist may work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CNC routers"},{"text":"Laser cutters"},{"text":"3D printers"},{"text":"Robotic arms"},{"text":"Robotic milling"},{"text":"Robotic 3D printing"},{"text":"Digital woodworking"},{"text":"Metal fabrication"},{"text":"Composite fabrication"},{"text":"3D scanning"},{"text":"Photogrammetry"},{"text":"Computational manufacturing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Digital Modeling + Geometry","Rhino / Grasshopper","Parametric & Computational Design","Digital Fabrication Fundamentals","CNC + Laser Cutting + 3D Printing","Robotic Fabrication","Design-to-Fabrication Workflow","